<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Reset Password</title>
    <style>
        *{
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }
        body{
            background-color: #232933;
            padding: 3rem;
        }
        .email-text{
            color: #ffffff75;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
        }
        .bottom-text{
            margin-top: 1.5rem;
        }
        .greet{
            color: white;
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2rem;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            margin-bottom: 1.5rem
        }
        .reset-password-link{
            width: 5rem;
            height: 3rem;
            align-content: center;
            background-color: #3e4b5bbd;
            padding: 1rem;
            border-radius: 0.25rem;
            text-decoration: none;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            color: #ffffff75;
            margin: 1rem 0;
        }
        .url{
            text-decoration: none;
            width: 100vw;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
            word-wrap: break-word;
            text-decoration: none;
            color: rgba(62, 121, 184, 0.862);
        }
        td{
            display: table-cell;
        }
        .line{
            border-top: 1px solid #ffffffc7;
            padding: 1rem 0;
        }
        .footer-text{
            text-align: center;
            padding: 0.5rem 0;
            color: #ffffff75;
            font-family: Arial, Helvetica, sans-serif;
            font-size: 0.9rem;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <p class="greet">Hello {{displayName}},</p>
    <p class="email-text">
        Your Kaiwa password can be reset by clicking the button below. 
        If you did not request a new password, please ignore this email.
    </p>
    <td>
        <a href={{url}} class="reset-password-link">
            Reset Password
        </a>
    </td>
    <p class="email-text bottom-text">
        If you're having trouble clicking the password reset button, copy and paste the following link into your web browser:
    </p>
    <p>
        <a href="{{url}}" class="url">
            {{ url }}
        </a>
    </p>
    <td>
        <p class="line">
        </p>
    </td>
    <td>
        <div class="footer-text">
            &copy; 2024 Kaiwa. All rights reserved.
        </div>
    </td>
</body>
</html>